// EXPECT: E0254 — `context` at file scope (ADR-0057 §3)
//
// A constant's value is computed by const-eval (ADR-0018 §3), which runs before any call — so there
// is no context to have been passed in. The message says that rather than "unresolved name", for the
// reason `type-errors/052` gives: `context` is a keyword, not a name.
BAD :: context.allocator;
